    <att name='institution'>Hakai Institute</att>
    <att name='title'>High Resolution Coastal Carbon Monitoring in the Northeast Pacific</att>
    <att name='summary'>This is a collection of high resolution coastal carbon monitoring datasets from instrumentation configured on shore-side infrastructure and oceanographic moorings in the Northeast Pacific beginning in 2014. These data provide information on the variability of inorganic carbon conditions over a range of temporal scales at select coastal sites in British Columbia.</att>
    <att name='project'>Oceanography</att>
    <att name='progress'>onGoing</att>
